AKGPT
This project is a derivative work inspired by BappyGPT
(https://github.com/entbappy/BappyGPT), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original: Google Gemini replaced by Groq; ChromaDB replaced by FAISS with
a SQLite docstore; OpenWeather tool, LangSmith tracing, session-scoped access control,
SSE event protocol, new frontend, Docker/CI and automated tests added.

Bundled third-party front-end libraries (static/vendor): marked (MIT) and DOMPurify
(Apache-2.0 / MPL-2.0; see static/vendor/dompurify.LICENSE).
